WEBVTT

00:20.350 --> 00:24.390
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:24.390 --> 00:30.090
♪ May we pass by the magnificent scenery ♪

00:30.980 --> 00:35.140
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:35.140 --> 00:40.910
♪ Could it be that both of us
are filled with desolation? ♪

00:41.790 --> 00:45.630
♪ As flowers bloom and wither ♪

00:45.630 --> 00:51.400
♪ May we lead such a life ♪

00:52.350 --> 00:56.520
♪ Contemplate the vastness
of Heaven and Earth ♪

00:56.520 --> 01:01.900
♪ Turning back, you and I ♪

01:05.740 --> 01:07.270
♪ Seize the current moment ♪

01:07.270 --> 01:10.920
♪ The sky is painted
with a gentle pallet of pastel colors ♪

01:10.920 --> 01:15.920
♪ Let's walk together ♪

01:16.360 --> 01:17.970
♪ Even if ♪

01:17.970 --> 01:21.660
♪ The snow in front of us ♪

01:21.680 --> 01:23.170
♪ Will dye our hair white ♪

01:23.170 --> 01:27.210
♪ In an instant ♪

01:27.210 --> 01:28.310
[Joy of Life Season 2]

01:28.310 --> 01:30.780
[Adapted from Mao Ni's Joy of Life
on Yuewen Group's Qidian platform]

01:30.780 --> 01:34.300
[Episode 10]

01:41.280 --> 01:42.479
What is that?

01:43.360 --> 01:45.000
His Majesty granted him a seat.

01:46.959 --> 01:49.260
Even the Crown Prince is standing,
you know? Who is he?

01:49.280 --> 01:51.320
The Commissioner-in-chief
of the Military Affairs Council,

01:51.321 --> 01:53.420
General Qin Ye.

01:53.440 --> 01:55.800
Commissioner-in-chief
of the Military Affairs Council?

01:56.920 --> 01:57.939
The head of the military.

01:57.959 --> 01:58.780
Precisely.

01:58.800 --> 02:00.540
All the Qing State armies

02:00.560 --> 02:02.960
are under the charge of General Qin.

02:03.030 --> 02:04.440
Why isn't he wearing an armor?

02:04.720 --> 02:07.600
He doesn't need to do so
for a court session.

02:10.800 --> 02:12.620
Who is the other chair

02:12.640 --> 02:14.239
expecting?

02:14.640 --> 02:15.840
Bow.

02:15.959 --> 02:16.880
Please don't.

02:16.880 --> 02:18.359
You don't have to do that.

02:18.800 --> 02:20.199
Not to you.

03:03.119 --> 03:04.460
Wake up.

03:04.480 --> 03:05.799
Everyone is watching.

03:06.080 --> 03:07.670
You are here, Prime Minister Lin.

03:08.239 --> 03:09.479
I wasn't sleeping.

03:09.559 --> 03:11.039
I have been awake.

03:19.050 --> 03:20.645
[Lin Ruofu, Prime Minister]

03:23.040 --> 03:25.419
Mr. Lin is cool.

03:25.439 --> 03:27.519
He is the head of all officials.

03:29.320 --> 03:30.580
Mr. Fan, you...

03:30.600 --> 03:32.160
This is my spot,

03:32.160 --> 03:33.740
so I will stand here from now on.

03:33.760 --> 03:35.780
Yours is over there.

03:35.800 --> 03:37.020
You can stand there.

03:37.040 --> 03:38.680
You are on your own now.

03:41.920 --> 03:43.160
Where is the throne?

03:43.320 --> 03:44.099
Pardon?

03:44.119 --> 03:45.759
That doesn't look like a throne.

03:50.519 --> 03:51.799
Why are you pulling me?

03:52.119 --> 03:54.340
His Majesty said the throne is hard,

03:54.360 --> 03:55.560
so he changed it.

03:56.239 --> 03:57.460
How willful of him.

03:57.480 --> 03:59.000
Keep it down.

03:59.660 --> 04:01.079
According to His Majesty,

04:01.600 --> 04:03.919
it doesn't matter
what the chair looks like.

04:04.080 --> 04:07.120
It depends on who sits on it.

04:08.600 --> 04:10.720
That sounds reasonable.

04:11.119 --> 04:13.000
Everything he says is reasonable.

04:19.439 --> 04:20.260
Speaking of which,

04:20.280 --> 04:23.099
except for His Majesty himself,

04:23.119 --> 04:24.619
only these two can be seated.

04:24.639 --> 04:25.500
It's three.

04:25.520 --> 04:27.159
There are only two chairs here.

04:30.480 --> 04:31.880
It's three, indeed.

04:51.239 --> 04:52.839
Have you been waiting for me?

05:04.319 --> 05:05.820
What are you people up to again?

05:05.840 --> 05:07.279
How's that?

05:07.600 --> 05:08.940
Did you teach Fan Xian

05:08.960 --> 05:10.500
to write the self-defense statement?

05:10.520 --> 05:12.099
It was his idea.

05:12.119 --> 05:13.940
Didn't you influence him?

05:13.960 --> 05:15.159
I didn't.

05:17.920 --> 05:20.599
I won't believe anything you say.

05:22.480 --> 05:24.619
As you know,
I can't say much in the hall later

05:24.639 --> 05:26.480
due to my identity.

05:27.160 --> 05:29.959
But the Imperial Procuratorate
is prejudiced.

05:30.639 --> 05:32.399
Please look out for him.

05:37.559 --> 05:38.800
Why the silence?

05:39.199 --> 05:40.560
I can't.

05:41.520 --> 05:42.820
I can't say a word at all.

05:42.840 --> 05:44.639
Don't give me that!

05:49.230 --> 05:50.519
Sorry for the trouble.

05:51.720 --> 05:52.920
Push harder.

06:01.280 --> 06:04.079
Has he always been like this?

06:05.239 --> 06:06.999
Don't tease General Qin.

06:06.999 --> 06:07.859
I'm just asking.

06:07.879 --> 06:09.199
Is that a problem?

06:10.879 --> 06:12.279
Fan Xian.

06:12.960 --> 06:14.040
It's me.

06:14.239 --> 06:15.360
Who are you?

06:15.800 --> 06:18.040
I read your anthology before.

06:18.110 --> 06:20.830
[Lai Mingcheng, Left Censor-in-chief]
I do appreciate your poems.

06:21.679 --> 06:23.000
I didn't write those poems.

06:23.679 --> 06:24.920
I know.

06:25.079 --> 06:26.700
Immortals deliver poems

06:26.720 --> 06:28.399
in your dream.

06:28.960 --> 06:30.659
It wasn't from the immortals
either.

06:30.679 --> 06:32.020
It's from another age.

06:32.040 --> 06:34.539
Well-educated men should

06:34.559 --> 06:36.240
always comport themselves well.

06:36.879 --> 06:39.519
How could you not know this?

06:40.600 --> 06:42.959
No matter who is behind you,

06:43.040 --> 06:45.800
no matter how fascinatingly
you can write,

06:45.879 --> 06:47.780
today, I must uphold the law

06:47.800 --> 06:49.399
and eradicate the evil.

06:49.559 --> 06:50.979
May I know who you are?

06:50.999 --> 06:53.360
This is Left Censor-in-chief,

06:53.679 --> 06:55.040
Lai Mingcheng.

06:55.280 --> 06:56.360
Your Highness.

06:56.679 --> 06:59.320
He is the most revered official
in the Imperial Procuratorate

06:59.679 --> 07:02.599
with his character and knowledge.

07:04.999 --> 07:07.539
Mr. Lai, save your energy

07:07.559 --> 07:08.800
for later.

07:09.480 --> 07:11.279
Pay me no mind, Your Highness.

07:12.079 --> 07:13.719
Whether you are loyal or corrupt,

07:13.800 --> 07:15.719
we will find out later.

07:21.920 --> 07:23.260
He is a nice person.

07:23.280 --> 07:24.780
He just lacks flexibility.

07:24.800 --> 07:27.240
That's why he still manages
the Imperial Procuratorate.

07:28.400 --> 07:29.979
What will you do later?

07:29.999 --> 07:30.920
I'm an honest man.

07:30.920 --> 07:32.760
Naturally, I face anything honestly.

07:33.040 --> 07:34.240
Honest man?

07:34.920 --> 07:36.480
That's good.

07:47.239 --> 07:49.099
Greetings, Your Highness.

07:49.119 --> 07:50.959
Don't be, Chengze.

07:51.480 --> 07:54.320
There is no need for courtesy
between brothers.

07:55.040 --> 07:58.560
Your words warm my heart up.

07:59.199 --> 08:00.380
Not too hot.

08:00.400 --> 08:02.140
And it cools down now.

08:02.160 --> 08:03.140
So soon?

08:03.160 --> 08:04.719
Same for you.

08:11.319 --> 08:13.199
Why hasn't Mr. Chen arrived yet?

08:14.520 --> 08:16.599
Grrr, this is not going to stop me.

08:17.079 --> 08:19.240
You are not as strong as before, right?

08:19.520 --> 08:21.140
You can't even push half my weight up.

08:21.160 --> 08:22.419
Just give up.

08:22.439 --> 08:24.480
Did you hide anything inside?

08:24.480 --> 08:25.560
So heavy.

08:26.559 --> 08:28.240
A powerful weapon.

08:29.559 --> 08:32.079
I won't believe anything you say.

08:51.760 --> 08:53.939
This won't do. I must go get help.

08:53.959 --> 08:54.740
Wait here.

08:54.760 --> 08:55.920
No need.

08:56.319 --> 08:57.640
Your help has come.

09:08.760 --> 09:09.840
Mr. Chen.

09:10.470 --> 09:12.100
You are here too, Your Highness.

09:12.120 --> 09:13.200
Allow me.

09:16.199 --> 09:17.179
When we first met,

09:17.199 --> 09:18.599
you stopped my horse.

09:19.199 --> 09:20.719
Why are you raking up the past?

09:21.079 --> 09:22.330
I knew you were bold.

09:22.350 --> 09:23.770
But I didn't expect you to be this bold.

09:23.790 --> 09:26.220
You actually confronted
the entire Imperial Procuratorate alone.

09:26.240 --> 09:26.900
Tough guy.

09:26.920 --> 09:28.539
It seems that you are here
to watch the show.

09:28.559 --> 09:29.719
Obviously.

09:30.959 --> 09:31.579
Chengru.

09:31.599 --> 09:32.720
Chengru.

09:43.240 --> 09:44.380
Why are you sweating?

09:44.400 --> 09:46.079
Don't get physical later.

09:48.079 --> 09:49.059
Don't worry.

09:49.079 --> 09:50.760
I'm not a lunatic.

09:54.679 --> 09:55.879
What's going on?

09:58.719 --> 09:59.869
His Majesty is arriving soon.

09:59.889 --> 10:01.900
Mr. Fan, hurry and return to your place.

10:01.920 --> 10:03.460
Remember to stay still.

10:03.480 --> 10:05.286
How many times
will they sound the gong?

10:06.839 --> 10:07.999
Just move already.

10:48.160 --> 10:49.240
Everyone,

10:49.559 --> 10:51.350
I believe you all know

10:51.370 --> 10:53.460
what happened
to the Imperial Procuratorate.

10:55.439 --> 10:58.400
Have you read
Fan Xian's self-defense statement?

11:04.359 --> 11:05.719
You didn't.

11:11.350 --> 11:13.940
[Traitorous officials are in power.
What crime have I committed?]

11:15.959 --> 11:17.760
Take a good look at it.

11:24.079 --> 11:26.280
Do read carefully.

11:35.559 --> 11:36.719
Lai Mingcheng.

11:38.959 --> 11:40.040
Yes, Your Majesty.

11:40.160 --> 11:41.999
What are you accusing him of?

11:43.319 --> 11:45.719
I'm accusing the Chief Musician Fan Xian

11:46.160 --> 11:47.879
of accepting bribes

11:48.000 --> 11:49.920
and abusing power.

11:51.880 --> 11:52.960
Fan Xian.

11:54.439 --> 11:55.380
Yes, Your Majesty.

11:55.400 --> 11:56.860
Do you plead guilty?

11:56.880 --> 11:58.140
I plead not guilty.

11:58.160 --> 12:00.020
He accused me of accepting bribes

12:00.040 --> 12:01.100
and abusing power,

12:01.120 --> 12:02.999
I don't quite understand.

12:04.040 --> 12:05.160
Lai Mingcheng.

12:05.640 --> 12:08.900
Crop Inspection Bureau bribed
Imperial Inspectorate First Division.

12:08.920 --> 12:10.819
Fan Xian accepted the bribe in public.

12:10.839 --> 12:12.100
There were many witnesses.

12:12.120 --> 12:13.800
This is completely truthful.

12:13.959 --> 12:15.220
Do you admit it?

12:15.240 --> 12:17.539
I didn't accept bribes. I'm innocent.

12:17.559 --> 12:18.640
Fan Xian.

12:18.920 --> 12:21.000
Here's the statement of the witnesses.

12:21.000 --> 12:22.590
[Crop Inspection Bureau Bribery Statement]
Are you trying to deny it?

12:22.599 --> 12:24.850
How can I admit it
when I didn't accept the bribe?

12:24.870 --> 12:26.295
[Qin Ye, Commissioner-in-chief]
Your Majesty,

12:26.297 --> 12:28.719
[of Military Affairs Council]
I request for the witness.

12:30.160 --> 12:31.839
No need for the trouble.

12:32.920 --> 12:35.879
Who in the Crop Inspection Bureau
committed bribery?

12:35.959 --> 12:37.299
Eunuch Dai.

12:37.319 --> 12:38.399
Summon him in.

12:39.040 --> 12:41.640
Bring Eunuch Dai in.

12:42.839 --> 12:46.479
Bring Eunuch Dai in.

12:47.240 --> 12:50.800
Bring Eunuch Dai in.

12:53.199 --> 12:54.279
Chen Pingping.

12:54.880 --> 12:55.999
Yes, Your Majesty.

12:56.120 --> 12:58.599
Fan Xian belongs
to your Imperial Inspectorate.

12:58.920 --> 13:00.680
How will you explain this?

13:00.880 --> 13:03.620
The Imperial Inspectorate
also serves you, Your Majesty.

13:03.640 --> 13:04.939
I respect the state laws

13:04.959 --> 13:06.100
and don't play favoritism.

13:06.120 --> 13:07.520
Do you think Fan Xian

13:07.520 --> 13:11.160
looks like someone
who engages in corruption?

13:14.240 --> 13:15.320
Yes.

13:16.040 --> 13:17.640
Uh...

13:19.640 --> 13:20.839
To be honest,

13:20.959 --> 13:22.640
since I took charge
of the Imperial Inspectorate,

13:22.640 --> 13:23.920
everyone

13:24.400 --> 13:26.359
seems suspicious to me.

13:28.280 --> 13:29.560
Did you hear that?

13:29.640 --> 13:30.880
How could he say that?

13:30.880 --> 13:32.479
Exactly.

13:42.400 --> 13:44.740
Everyone seems suspicious?

13:44.760 --> 13:46.479
Yes.

13:50.760 --> 13:52.400
Let me see.

14:23.040 --> 14:25.119
Does the Prime Minister look like one?

14:35.839 --> 14:36.999
He's more like it.

14:37.760 --> 14:40.479
How can Prime Minister Lin be corrupt?

14:41.479 --> 14:43.040
This is nonsense.

14:43.520 --> 14:45.079
Mr. Chen,

14:45.359 --> 14:47.040
you have good eyes.

14:47.160 --> 14:50.119
Please pardon my poor, old eyesight.

14:50.959 --> 14:52.119
Prime Minister Lin,

14:52.640 --> 14:56.479
Mr. Chen was kidding you.

14:56.520 --> 14:59.440
I like jokes.

15:00.000 --> 15:03.539
Both of you are close to Fan Xian.

15:03.559 --> 15:05.199
Your words aren't convincing.

15:06.160 --> 15:07.240
General Qin.

15:07.479 --> 15:08.599
Yes, Your Majesty.

15:10.079 --> 15:14.599
Do you think Fan Xian
looks like a corrupt official?

15:15.479 --> 15:16.560
Your Majesty,

15:17.120 --> 15:19.500
all I know is fighting in wars.

15:19.520 --> 15:21.520
I don't know anything else.

15:23.400 --> 15:24.640
However,

15:26.640 --> 15:28.900
I don't think he looks like one.

15:28.920 --> 15:30.079
Why?

15:30.880 --> 15:33.560
Fan Xian went to Northern Qi
as a diplomat,

15:33.760 --> 15:37.320
and he raised the war flag
of the Qing State in their capital.

15:37.719 --> 15:39.319
We soldiers

15:39.319 --> 15:42.160
were thrilled to see that.

15:43.359 --> 15:44.640
Rightfully so.

15:44.719 --> 15:45.299
That's right.

15:45.319 --> 15:46.999
I also heard about that.

15:49.359 --> 15:52.199
A young man with such bravado

15:52.760 --> 15:54.719
doesn't look like a corrupt person.

15:56.640 --> 15:58.479
Thank you, General Qin.

16:00.400 --> 16:03.119
I'm just stating the truth.

16:04.439 --> 16:09.920
I heard something was going on
between you and Northern Qi Holy Maiden.

16:16.520 --> 16:17.879
Attaboy.

16:19.959 --> 16:21.059
General Qin,

16:21.079 --> 16:22.939
that's a rumor.

16:22.959 --> 16:24.359
It might be true.

16:24.359 --> 16:25.780
Mr. Lin,

16:25.800 --> 16:27.160
that's not true.

16:32.439 --> 16:34.240
I was just talking nonsense.

16:34.240 --> 16:36.280
Please don't take it personally.

16:37.599 --> 16:38.920
I know.

16:52.959 --> 16:54.520
Isn't that Eunuch Dai?

17:02.359 --> 17:03.579
My shoe falls.

17:03.599 --> 17:05.879
Please let me put on my shoe
before entering the hall.

17:06.760 --> 17:07.840
I...

17:08.399 --> 17:09.479
I...

17:10.760 --> 17:12.220
Impropriety in His Majesty's presence

17:12.240 --> 17:14.480
is very likely
to get you all in trouble.

17:38.359 --> 17:39.599
He is bold.

17:39.599 --> 17:40.940
He sure is.

17:40.960 --> 17:42.399
Unbelievable.

17:53.839 --> 17:55.359
Greetings,

17:55.559 --> 17:58.240
Your Majesty.

17:59.159 --> 18:00.320
Lai Mingcheng.

18:05.359 --> 18:06.679
Eunuch Dai.

18:07.559 --> 18:08.760
Please read this.

18:18.040 --> 18:19.679
This is the statement.

18:19.760 --> 18:23.339
After the First Division
sealed the Crop Inspection Bureau off,

18:23.359 --> 18:25.467
Eunuch Dai arrived immediately

18:25.487 --> 18:28.767
and gave Fan Xian banknotes
worth 3,000 taels.

18:28.800 --> 18:30.040
Eunuch Dai,

18:30.280 --> 18:32.320
do you admit this?

18:32.680 --> 18:33.919
No, I...

18:34.240 --> 18:35.099
I...

18:35.119 --> 18:36.859
Did that really happen

18:36.879 --> 18:38.639
in front of the public?

18:39.559 --> 18:41.539
That just sounds unreasonable.

18:41.559 --> 18:42.639
Right?

18:42.760 --> 18:44.399
He sealed the letter.

18:44.639 --> 18:47.379
Then, how did you know the sealed letter
contain banknotes?

18:47.399 --> 18:49.480
Fan Xian opened it right away.

18:49.599 --> 18:50.953
Not only that,

18:50.973 --> 18:53.213
but he also announced the figure.

18:53.480 --> 18:58.520
Everyone there witnessed it.

18:59.159 --> 19:01.660
Concerning his outrageous behavior,

19:01.680 --> 19:03.480
it shows how arrogant

19:04.319 --> 19:07.280
Fan Xian is.

19:09.599 --> 19:10.930
Why are you looking at me?

19:10.950 --> 19:12.439
You are being questioned.

19:13.159 --> 19:14.280
Answer.

19:16.440 --> 19:17.599
Eunuch Dai,

19:17.839 --> 19:19.299
this is solid evidence.

19:19.319 --> 19:20.919
Think carefully.

19:22.359 --> 19:23.439
Eunuch Dai.

19:25.200 --> 19:27.879
Don't panic. 3,000 taels isn't much.

19:28.440 --> 19:30.740
Crop Inspection Bureau is
under the charge of the harem.

19:30.760 --> 19:33.439
You won't be affected
by this mere crime.

19:33.480 --> 19:35.000
3,000 taels?

19:35.159 --> 19:38.159
That's just the tip of the iceberg.

19:45.720 --> 19:46.800
Your Majesty,

19:46.960 --> 19:51.046
Imperial Procuratorate
has investigated thoroughly.

19:51.066 --> 19:53.899
Crop Inspection Bureau
has done so many evil deeds

19:53.919 --> 19:56.200
that evidence of their crime
could be found easily.

19:56.290 --> 19:57.390
According to the investigation,

19:57.399 --> 20:01.180
Crop Inspection Bureau has been
exploiting the farmers by all means

20:01.200 --> 20:02.825
over the years.

20:02.845 --> 20:04.619
This Eunuch Dai

20:04.639 --> 20:07.980
has more than one private property
outside the Capital.

20:08.000 --> 20:10.500
He even framed quite a number of farmers

20:10.520 --> 20:12.400
with the crop prices,

20:12.420 --> 20:14.359
which forced them
to sell their children,

20:14.520 --> 20:16.819
or even send their daughters

20:16.839 --> 20:18.760
to the brothel.

20:18.919 --> 20:20.800
Such evil doings

20:21.000 --> 20:22.720
have enraged the people.

20:22.839 --> 20:27.320
Crop Inspection Bureau is also secretly
known as the "Bleeding Flesh Bureau".

20:31.399 --> 20:33.079
Mr. Lai, you are so sure
of your accusations,

20:33.079 --> 20:36.560
but I wonder if your evidence is solid.

20:36.599 --> 20:37.940
The evidence is conclusive.

20:37.960 --> 20:39.679
Please review it, Your Majesty.

20:45.680 --> 20:47.359
Mr. Lai.

20:50.240 --> 20:51.520
Prime Minister Lin.

20:52.520 --> 20:55.579
The laws of the Qing State are strict.

20:55.599 --> 20:58.780
From Ministry of Justice, and Court
of Judicial Review to the local yamen,

20:58.800 --> 21:00.760
every system has its own responsibility.

21:00.800 --> 21:03.240
Even if an official breaks the law,

21:03.399 --> 21:06.320
he should be investigated
according to the protocol.

21:06.639 --> 21:08.539
How could you present the evidence

21:08.559 --> 21:11.720
directly to His Majesty?

21:11.839 --> 21:12.940
Prime Minister Lin,

21:12.960 --> 21:13.879
are you suggesting

21:13.879 --> 21:16.439
that I shouldn't read the memorandum?

21:17.079 --> 21:19.220
Your Majesty,
you are the ruler of the state.

21:19.240 --> 21:21.099
There is nothing
you should be hidden from.

21:21.119 --> 21:23.819
However, I'm the head
of the Six Ministries,

21:23.839 --> 21:26.539
and it's my duty to share your burden.

21:26.559 --> 21:28.180
If we were to burden you

21:28.200 --> 21:30.000
with such matters for long,

21:30.040 --> 21:32.320
I'm afraid the Six Ministries
might slack off

21:32.599 --> 21:34.760
and law enforcement
might be undermined.

21:35.119 --> 21:36.520
You have a point.

21:37.159 --> 21:39.720
I shouldn't look at it.

21:40.040 --> 21:41.599
No, Prime Minister Lin.

21:42.879 --> 21:46.059
First, Crop Inspection Bureau
is under the charge of the harem.

21:46.079 --> 21:47.700
So it should be judged by His Majesty.

21:47.720 --> 21:51.720
Second, Imperial Procuratorate
has a duty for official impeachment.

21:51.720 --> 21:53.660
So presenting the evidence
directly to His Majesty

21:53.680 --> 21:55.020
is not considered overstepping.

21:55.040 --> 21:56.700
What about the third point?

21:56.720 --> 21:58.079
Third,

21:58.720 --> 22:01.299
the Six Ministries are
under your jurisdiction.

22:01.319 --> 22:04.460
I impeach Fan Xian for his conduct
in the Crop Inspection Bureau case.

22:04.480 --> 22:05.986
As everyone knows,

22:06.006 --> 22:08.645
Fan Xian is your future son-in-law.

22:08.727 --> 22:12.086
By right, you should recuse yourself.

22:18.079 --> 22:21.980
Mr. Lai, are you suggesting
that I play favoritism?

22:22.000 --> 22:24.000
Everyone has their favorite.

22:24.200 --> 22:26.270
Prime Minister Lin
is incorruptible and upright.

22:26.290 --> 22:28.092
Speaking of you playing favoritism,

22:28.919 --> 22:30.720
I'm the first to oppose.

22:30.839 --> 22:32.520
I'm the second.

22:33.919 --> 22:35.200
Your Majesty,

22:35.520 --> 22:38.027
Mr. Lai has made a fair point.

22:38.047 --> 22:39.886
The Crop Inspection Bureau case

22:40.040 --> 22:42.879
should be judged by you.

22:43.159 --> 22:45.040
You have my trust.

22:45.119 --> 22:49.560
But I don't quite trust myself.

22:51.720 --> 22:52.780
Lai Mingcheng.

22:52.800 --> 22:53.780
Yes, Your Majesty.

22:53.800 --> 22:55.520
Show him.

23:03.480 --> 23:06.639
I'm to blame.

23:07.159 --> 23:09.420
Please spare me, Your Majesty!

23:09.440 --> 23:11.940
I will give up everything

23:11.960 --> 23:14.639
and make amends!

23:15.960 --> 23:17.040
Your Majesty,

23:17.480 --> 23:18.919
he pleaded guilty.

23:19.000 --> 23:21.159
Reduce him to ashes.

23:21.680 --> 23:22.879
Take him away!

23:28.440 --> 23:31.020
Please show me mercy, Your Majesty!

23:31.040 --> 23:33.299
Please show me mercy, Your Majesty!

23:33.319 --> 23:34.819
Please!

23:34.839 --> 23:36.919
Your Majesty!

23:40.599 --> 23:43.940
Mr. Fan, seeing how he ends,

23:43.960 --> 23:45.720
what do you think?

23:46.480 --> 23:48.690
This Dai is a piece of work.

23:48.710 --> 23:50.280
Mr. Lai, you eradicate the evil
for the people.

23:50.280 --> 23:52.110
They will remember what you have done.

23:53.319 --> 23:54.919
At this point,

23:55.399 --> 23:56.539
do you plead guilty?

23:56.559 --> 23:57.980
Why am I guilty?

23:58.000 --> 24:00.539
You dare say
you didn't take the 3,000 taels?

24:00.559 --> 24:01.839
I did take it.

24:02.399 --> 24:03.619
So you admitted.

24:03.639 --> 24:04.719
Hold on.

24:04.879 --> 24:06.460
Are you saying

24:06.480 --> 24:09.299
that I took a bribe
if I accepted the money?

24:09.319 --> 24:11.079
Don't you try to deny it!

24:16.599 --> 24:18.119
Mr. Lai,

24:19.159 --> 24:22.359
how dare you slander a prince!

24:25.150 --> 24:26.619
What nonsense are you talking about?

24:26.639 --> 24:27.599
Did I take the bank notes

24:27.599 --> 24:29.310
from Crop Inspection Bureau
in front of everyone?

24:29.319 --> 24:30.660
That's the reason

24:30.680 --> 24:32.780
why we established the evidence.

24:32.800 --> 24:34.159
Let me ask you this.

24:34.559 --> 24:36.059
Was His Highness also there?

24:36.079 --> 24:37.200
His Highness?

24:37.399 --> 24:39.040
His Highness was there.

24:43.159 --> 24:44.740
Yes, he was.

24:44.760 --> 24:46.420
If I had violated the state laws,

24:46.440 --> 24:47.780
why didn't His Highness impeach me

24:47.800 --> 24:50.439
when all this happened days ago?

24:52.280 --> 24:54.079
Mr. Lai, you claimed
that I accepted bribes,

24:54.079 --> 24:55.820
[Forced Prostitution]
yet His Highness ignored this.

24:55.820 --> 24:59.630
[at Baoyue Pleasure House]
Doesn't that mean His Highness and I conspired?

25:00.960 --> 25:01.539
This...

25:01.559 --> 25:03.119
Slandering the prince

25:03.399 --> 25:04.800
is utterly vicious.

25:04.800 --> 25:06.639
Why would His Highness be there?

25:19.839 --> 25:22.240
It's true that I was
in the Crop Inspection Bureau.

25:22.559 --> 25:23.639
Did you

25:26.119 --> 25:27.879
see him take the money?

25:28.159 --> 25:30.340
I did. As Mr. Lai said,

25:30.340 --> 25:32.119
he violated the state law
by receiving that 3,000 taels.

25:32.119 --> 25:34.280
I should've impeached Fan Xian
for his misconduct.

25:35.480 --> 25:37.320
Then, why didn't you impeach me?

25:37.919 --> 25:39.399
Because I trust you.

25:42.000 --> 25:43.210
Fan Xian boasts exceptional talents.

25:43.210 --> 25:45.630
He is widely known as the Immortal Poet
soon after he entered the Capital.

25:45.639 --> 25:47.410
Plus, he is an important official
in the Imperial Inspectorate.

25:47.410 --> 25:49.059
He has a great prospect.

25:49.079 --> 25:51.310
I couldn't believe someone like him

25:51.319 --> 25:53.460
would ruin his future for 3,000 taels.

25:53.480 --> 25:54.520
If he really did that,

25:54.520 --> 25:56.079
I would definitely impeach him.

25:56.079 --> 25:59.980
However, seeing him publicly accept a bribe
is somehow unthinkable.

26:00.000 --> 26:02.220
I believed he had another intention.

26:02.240 --> 26:05.819
Hence, I decided to wait and observe.

26:05.839 --> 26:07.159
Well said.

26:07.399 --> 26:09.240
You actually speak

26:10.440 --> 26:11.960
my thoughts out loud.

26:23.680 --> 26:27.579
Perhaps you thought 3,000 taels
wasn't a big enough figure,

26:27.599 --> 26:29.139
so you decided to take the risk.

26:29.159 --> 26:30.480
This is absurd!

26:30.839 --> 26:31.859
People in the Capital

26:31.879 --> 26:33.899
can't even save up a dozen taels
within a year.

26:33.919 --> 26:35.500
The banknotes worth 3,000 taels

26:35.520 --> 26:36.280
are a huge sum

26:36.280 --> 26:38.299
they could ever imagine.

26:38.319 --> 26:39.520
We are the serving officials.

26:39.520 --> 26:41.399
Of course, we should obey the law
and care about the people.

26:41.399 --> 26:43.339
Mr. Lai, what you said

26:43.359 --> 26:45.439
is truly disheartening!

26:52.480 --> 26:55.000
But you took that 3,000 taels.

26:55.000 --> 26:55.940
Yes.

26:55.960 --> 26:57.159
You took the money.

26:57.159 --> 26:58.299
I did.

26:58.319 --> 26:59.940
Mr. Lai, have you ever gone fishing?

26:59.960 --> 27:01.379
Without a bait,

27:01.399 --> 27:02.879
would the fish bite?

27:03.760 --> 27:05.859
So you deliberately accepted the bribe

27:05.879 --> 27:08.059
to lure the Crop Inspection Bureau?

27:08.079 --> 27:09.420
As a matter of fact,

27:09.440 --> 27:11.910
I have long noticed the evildoing
at the Crop Inspection Bureau.

27:11.919 --> 27:13.299
My thought of eradicating the evil

27:13.319 --> 27:15.359
aligns perfectly with yours.

27:15.559 --> 27:16.539
"Great minds think alike"

27:16.559 --> 27:18.240
is the exact description for us both.

27:19.440 --> 27:20.560
Look,

27:20.599 --> 27:23.480
what a smooth talker he is.

27:23.480 --> 27:25.220
Still, that's the truth.

27:25.240 --> 27:28.339
You say you are also investigating
the Crop Inspection Bureau.

27:28.359 --> 27:29.839
Can you prove it?

27:30.079 --> 27:31.579
Right after I took the banknotes,

27:31.599 --> 27:32.980
I have handed them over to Mr. Chen.

27:33.000 --> 27:35.960
I also reported my intention
to Mr. Chen.

27:39.319 --> 27:40.399
Is that true?

27:41.720 --> 27:42.800
It's true.

27:43.000 --> 27:45.359
Isn't this a misunderstanding, then?

27:46.319 --> 27:48.520
Yes, it's always a misunderstanding.

27:52.919 --> 27:54.079
Mr. Chen,

27:54.359 --> 27:56.200
it's not that I doubt you.

27:56.800 --> 27:59.760
I would like to ask one more thing.

28:01.559 --> 28:02.639
Mr. Fan,

28:02.879 --> 28:05.180
if you said this is a misunderstanding,

28:05.200 --> 28:09.599
why didn't you explain everything

28:09.720 --> 28:12.220
on your self-defense statement

28:12.240 --> 28:14.399
when all officials impeached you?

28:14.879 --> 28:18.260
Mr. Lai, I wouldn't dare to do so.

28:18.280 --> 28:19.360
Why not?

28:21.440 --> 28:23.099
How could a small Crop Inspection Bureau

28:23.119 --> 28:24.780
have such audacity?

28:24.800 --> 28:27.020
Officials engaged in corruption
in the court

28:27.040 --> 28:29.000
are more to this than meets the eye.

28:40.399 --> 28:43.330
Do you also suspect
the Imperial Procuratorate?

28:43.350 --> 28:45.059
Not just the Imperial Procuratorate,

28:45.079 --> 28:46.539
but also all the officials

28:46.559 --> 28:48.240
and imperial family members.

28:48.839 --> 28:50.119
I

28:50.399 --> 28:52.200
don't believe any of them.

28:56.639 --> 28:58.480
Since you are investigating corruption,

28:58.800 --> 29:02.420
why did you keep those banknotes
for so long

29:02.440 --> 29:04.879
without taking any action?

29:05.159 --> 29:06.780
If it wasn't
for the Imperial Procuratorate,

29:06.800 --> 29:11.000
I doubt the Crop Inspection Bureau
would be exposed by now.

29:13.000 --> 29:14.679
I hesitated.

29:15.200 --> 29:16.440
What do you mean?

29:16.460 --> 29:18.000
The corruption investigation
is necessary.

29:18.000 --> 29:20.020
The question is,
how long will it continue?

29:20.040 --> 29:20.980
How deep can it delve into?

29:21.000 --> 29:22.020
Are you chickening out?

29:22.040 --> 29:24.359
No, I'm worried.

29:24.559 --> 29:28.660
Upholding integrity in governance
is the fundamental of officials.

29:28.680 --> 29:30.660
Since we are trusted by His Majesty,

29:30.680 --> 29:32.540
how could we shirk our duty?

29:32.560 --> 29:34.500
Mr. Lai,
does this only represent yourself

29:34.520 --> 29:36.020
or the entire Imperial Procuratorate?

29:36.040 --> 29:40.320
The whole Imperial Procuratorate
has the duty to serve the nation.

29:40.839 --> 29:43.320
What the Imperial Inspectorate
dare not investigate,

29:43.440 --> 29:45.480
the Imperial Procuratorate will!

29:45.760 --> 29:48.079
What the Imperial Inspectorate fear,

29:48.639 --> 29:50.919
the Imperial Procuratorate do not!

29:52.919 --> 29:53.740
What a spirit.

29:53.760 --> 29:54.619
I'm impressed.

29:54.639 --> 29:56.679
Did you hear that,

29:57.079 --> 29:58.339
Chen Pingping?

29:58.359 --> 30:00.599
I'm ashamed.

30:01.079 --> 30:02.119
Imperial Inspectorate

30:02.119 --> 30:05.240
has truly been slacking off
over the years.

30:06.119 --> 30:08.560
You owe me an explanation.

30:09.079 --> 30:10.159
Your Majesty,

30:10.879 --> 30:12.439
during this time,

30:12.800 --> 30:16.379
several local yamens
have uncovered cases of corruption,

30:16.399 --> 30:19.520
which involve numerous parties.

30:19.800 --> 30:21.060
I intended to delay it.

30:21.080 --> 30:22.720
Judging by today's situation,

30:23.960 --> 30:28.260
I should hand over this duty
to the Imperial Procuratorate.

30:28.280 --> 30:29.919
Mr. Chen, did you prepare

30:29.919 --> 30:31.899
this name list long ago?

30:31.919 --> 30:34.170
Today is a coincidence.

30:34.190 --> 30:36.439
So, have you been waiting
for this moment to come?

30:36.559 --> 30:38.819
If the Imperial Procuratorate
won't take this,

30:38.839 --> 30:41.639
we won't force it on you.

30:41.960 --> 30:44.070
Since corrupt officials
have been discovered,

30:44.090 --> 30:45.399
why doesn't the Imperial Inspectorate

30:45.399 --> 30:48.639
tie up the loose ends as well?

30:49.480 --> 30:52.819
Why offer this favor to others instead?

30:52.839 --> 30:55.079
That's why
I say it involves numerous parties.

30:56.680 --> 30:59.359
Is the Imperial Inspectorate afraid too?

31:01.079 --> 31:02.639
Not really.

31:03.839 --> 31:07.280
It's time-consuming and labor-intensive.

31:08.090 --> 31:09.919
Some of the officials are
far away from the Capital,

31:09.919 --> 31:12.299
but they have close connections here,

31:12.319 --> 31:13.800
even

31:14.680 --> 31:17.180
with the princes.

31:17.200 --> 31:20.240
If we were to scrutinize it thoroughly,

31:22.079 --> 31:24.040
it might take a long time.

31:25.399 --> 31:27.960
Imperial Inspectorate
has already a lot on our plate,

31:29.000 --> 31:30.879
and we can't spare
any more effort for it.

31:34.760 --> 31:37.441
General Qin,
since you have asked so deeply,

31:42.325 --> 31:43.859
why don't you have a look at it?

31:43.879 --> 31:44.959
No, thanks.

31:45.960 --> 31:47.660
I can't read,

31:47.680 --> 31:49.480
and I won't understand it.

31:49.960 --> 31:51.040
So no.

31:58.350 --> 31:59.599
Prime Minister Lin?

32:18.919 --> 32:21.040
So no one dares take this.

32:21.639 --> 32:22.719
Your Majesty,

32:23.000 --> 32:24.180
this name list

32:24.200 --> 32:26.480
will be taken
by the Imperial Procuratorate.

32:26.950 --> 32:29.780
We won't back down from the task
of relieving the country from trouble.

32:29.800 --> 32:31.830
Your loyalty and bravery
are commendable.

32:32.280 --> 32:34.520
Read it before you say yes.

32:55.319 --> 32:56.339
Your Majesty,

32:56.359 --> 32:58.200
there is something I must say now.

32:58.399 --> 32:59.619
Your Majesty,

32:59.639 --> 33:01.579
Mr. Lai is loyal and righteous.

33:01.599 --> 33:03.020
I admire him very much.

33:03.040 --> 33:05.700
If this concerns the princes,

33:05.720 --> 33:08.660
I'm worried Mr. Lai couldn't bear
this heavy burden.

33:08.680 --> 33:10.320
With the state law,

33:10.399 --> 33:11.859
why wouldn't I bear it?

33:11.879 --> 33:13.299
I will thoroughly investigate

33:13.319 --> 33:15.299
and clear the name
of the royal family.

33:15.319 --> 33:19.200
If any princes were involved...

33:19.280 --> 33:21.420
Mr. Lai,
please consider your own safety.

33:21.440 --> 33:23.000
Don't be impulsive.

33:26.800 --> 33:28.370
[Name List of Corrupt Officials]

33:29.079 --> 33:30.200
Your Majesty,

33:30.879 --> 33:34.439
even if any princes were involved,

33:34.800 --> 33:38.560
Imperial Procuratorate
will get to the bottom of this.

33:39.879 --> 33:41.170
The courageous censor

33:41.190 --> 33:42.960
fearlessly opposes the royal family

33:43.079 --> 33:45.220
and vows to uproot evil

33:45.240 --> 33:47.180
and preserve
an incorruptible government.

33:47.200 --> 33:50.000
This is truly a blessing
to the Qing State.

33:50.159 --> 33:52.059
Having a courageous censor

33:52.079 --> 33:54.560
is truly a blessing to the Qing State.

33:54.800 --> 33:55.539
Your Majesty,

33:55.559 --> 33:57.619
Mr. Lai is the guardian of the country.

33:57.639 --> 34:00.919
I would like to take back the words
I wrote to the Imperial Procuratorate.

34:01.079 --> 34:03.180
Do you think
you can take them back as you wish?

34:03.200 --> 34:05.520
I will apologize to them
and admit my fault.

34:05.879 --> 34:06.940
Fan Xian.

34:06.960 --> 34:07.539
Yes, Your Majesty.

34:07.559 --> 34:09.120
You wrote in the self-defense statement,

34:09.120 --> 34:11.120
"Traitorous officials are in power."

34:11.479 --> 34:12.959
I wonder

34:13.919 --> 34:15.800
who you are referring to.

34:22.359 --> 34:24.280
Needless to say,
it's all the corrupt officials,

34:24.280 --> 34:27.320
not the censors
of the Imperial Procuratorate.

34:30.800 --> 34:31.700
Lai Mingcheng.

34:31.720 --> 34:32.800
Yes, Your Majesty.

34:33.359 --> 34:35.060
Do it well.

34:35.080 --> 34:36.160
Your Majesty.

34:38.240 --> 34:43.600
I shall return a clear, bright sky
to the Qing State.

34:43.760 --> 34:46.439
I'm looking forward to it.

34:49.000 --> 34:50.200
Prime Minister Lin.

35:08.879 --> 35:10.200
Let me help you.

35:10.359 --> 35:12.160
I'm not that old.

35:14.760 --> 35:17.860
Mr. Lin, I was impressed
by you just now.

35:17.880 --> 35:19.979
You were seeking for someone
to do the dirty work.

35:19.999 --> 35:21.079
Sorry?

35:21.360 --> 35:24.320
You use the Imperial Procuratorate
to investigate the Second Prince.

35:30.919 --> 35:32.800
I know I can't keep it from you.

35:32.879 --> 35:34.740
Did Chen Pingping teach you this?

35:34.760 --> 35:36.200
I figured it out myself.

35:38.359 --> 35:41.559
Lai Mingcheng is indeed a good choice.

35:43.399 --> 35:45.290
But there is something
I'm confused about.

35:45.310 --> 35:46.959
I would like to seek your advice.

35:47.879 --> 35:50.200
The officials who came out just now

35:50.280 --> 35:52.200
weren't part of my arrangement.

35:52.720 --> 35:54.740
If it wasn't for them
fanning the flames,

35:54.760 --> 35:56.600
it wouldn't have turned out so well.

35:57.160 --> 35:58.559
You are curious

35:59.560 --> 36:01.640
about who is behind them?

36:07.519 --> 36:08.879
Did you arrange that?

36:10.080 --> 36:13.350
But how did you know
my target is the Second Prince in advance?

36:13.359 --> 36:15.359
I didn't hold this position for years

36:15.479 --> 36:17.320
for nothing.

36:18.280 --> 36:19.760
Will those officials

36:19.839 --> 36:21.439
affect you?

36:22.399 --> 36:24.919
Who tells you they are my men?

36:28.080 --> 36:29.160
No?

36:30.839 --> 36:32.559
Then whose men are they?

36:33.519 --> 36:34.599
Chengze.

36:36.240 --> 36:37.559
Chengze, slow down.

36:37.959 --> 36:39.640
Do you have any orders, Your Highness?

36:40.240 --> 36:42.420
It was quite a day in the court
earlier today.

36:42.440 --> 36:43.919
What do you think, Chengze?

36:44.039 --> 36:46.439
Mr. Lai is indeed unbending.

36:47.319 --> 36:50.580
Imperial Procuratorate
has been a spent force for years.

36:50.600 --> 36:52.720
Those censors were struggling.

36:53.640 --> 36:56.439
Otherwise, they wouldn't have
taken the corruption investigation.

36:57.200 --> 36:58.290
Anyway,

36:58.310 --> 37:00.800
it's good to have
the corruption investigation proceed.

37:00.999 --> 37:03.800
It's a good thing
as long as it is not a personal grudge.

37:04.879 --> 37:06.080
How is that

37:06.359 --> 37:07.720
a personal grudge?

37:10.240 --> 37:13.120
Do you know by chance

37:13.640 --> 37:15.519
who is on the name list?

37:16.640 --> 37:17.760
I don't know.

37:21.919 --> 37:24.120
We should always reflect on ourselves.

37:24.560 --> 37:26.160
As princes,

37:26.319 --> 37:28.919
we should be aware
of the officials who approach us

37:29.080 --> 37:30.780
and not bring disgrace
to the royal family.

37:30.800 --> 37:32.060
Am I right, Chengze?

37:32.080 --> 37:34.559
Your Highness,
your words are profound.

37:34.879 --> 37:37.340
I'm just speaking from the heart.

37:37.360 --> 37:39.060
You see, those officials
who came out just now

37:39.080 --> 37:40.499
enthusiastically praised

37:40.519 --> 37:42.100
the courageous censor.

37:42.120 --> 37:44.290
It's rare to see

37:44.310 --> 37:45.819
officials clearly show their stances.

37:45.839 --> 37:47.320
Do you know what that means?

37:47.359 --> 37:49.540
The corruption investigation
is everyone's hope,

37:49.560 --> 37:50.999
and it's inevitable.

37:55.200 --> 37:56.280
What's wrong?

37:57.879 --> 37:58.959
I'm impressed.

38:00.600 --> 38:02.039
How so?

38:02.319 --> 38:04.200
Smashing bowls in front of the chef.

38:04.319 --> 38:05.780
Your Highness,

38:05.800 --> 38:07.070
that takes finesse.

38:07.839 --> 38:09.720
What chef?

38:10.039 --> 38:11.379
I won't forget

38:11.399 --> 38:12.780
your guidance.

38:12.800 --> 38:14.439
Not for one moment.

38:25.800 --> 38:26.880
Your Highness.

38:31.519 --> 38:33.459
Shall we

38:33.479 --> 38:35.979
give Mr. Lai a little help?

38:35.999 --> 38:37.120
We?

38:37.600 --> 38:38.800
What are you on about?

38:41.240 --> 38:42.339
Your Highness, this way.

38:42.359 --> 38:44.879
Please.

38:49.800 --> 38:51.740
As your aides,

38:51.760 --> 38:53.660
we should do our best to serve you.

38:53.680 --> 38:54.480
Hold on.

38:54.500 --> 38:56.430
Those from the Imperial Procuratorate
are simple-minded

38:56.439 --> 38:57.700
and insist on conducting
the investigation.

38:57.700 --> 38:59.140
We can just sit tight and watch.

38:59.160 --> 39:00.760
Why should we get our hands dirty?

39:04.360 --> 39:05.640
What's with that look?

39:07.039 --> 39:08.839
Aren't those officials

39:08.879 --> 39:10.999
arranged by you?

39:11.600 --> 39:13.120
Who are you talking about?

39:14.439 --> 39:16.100
There were a few officials

39:16.120 --> 39:17.839
voicing out just now.

39:17.839 --> 39:20.160
What do you mean by "I arranged them"?

39:21.280 --> 39:23.419
Aren't they your aides?

39:23.439 --> 39:25.060
Wait, what do you mean by "my aides"?

39:25.080 --> 39:26.459
They have always been.

39:26.479 --> 39:28.120
Then why don't I know about that?

39:30.039 --> 39:31.240
That's right.

39:32.080 --> 39:33.160
Well,

39:33.439 --> 39:36.100
many people pledge
their loyalty to you.

39:36.120 --> 39:37.505
Those few

39:37.525 --> 39:38.819
are in idle positions

39:38.839 --> 39:40.220
and won't be of great help.

39:40.240 --> 39:44.299
They probably haven't had a chance
to meet with you.

39:44.319 --> 39:45.959
Are they really my aides?

39:46.039 --> 39:47.680
Absolutely.

39:57.999 --> 39:59.600
Why did they come out?

40:00.600 --> 40:01.979
Wasn't that your idea?

40:01.999 --> 40:03.540
As if!

40:03.560 --> 40:05.760
Why did they come out
in that situation?

40:08.959 --> 40:11.240
No wonder he talked
about the chef and the bowls.

40:11.720 --> 40:13.459
Chef?

40:13.479 --> 40:14.680
What chef?

40:14.790 --> 40:16.430
From the Crop Inspection Bureau?

40:25.919 --> 40:28.999
Did the Crown Prince's aides
follow your orders?

40:29.120 --> 40:30.680
That's feasible.

40:32.039 --> 40:33.479
This is amazing, Mr. Lin.

40:33.760 --> 40:35.399
I'm not as amazing as you.

40:35.959 --> 40:37.660
You have been back for days,

40:37.680 --> 40:39.320
yet you haven't visited Wan'er yet.

40:39.760 --> 40:40.840
Why?

40:41.479 --> 40:43.519
Does the Northern Qi Holy Maiden
stop you?

40:44.919 --> 40:45.999
Mr. Lin.

40:46.999 --> 40:48.700
Please don't believe in those rumors.

40:48.720 --> 40:50.439
The Holy Maiden and I...

40:52.120 --> 40:53.640
Wan'er and I...

40:54.399 --> 40:56.379
You know very well
what kind of person I am.

40:56.399 --> 40:58.580
Don't tell me. Explain to Wan'er.

40:58.600 --> 41:00.060
It's not that I don't want to meet her.

41:00.080 --> 41:02.030
I have been too occupied
since returning to the Capital.

41:02.039 --> 41:03.339
I'm all tied up.

41:03.359 --> 41:04.879
This is not an excuse.

41:05.319 --> 41:06.399
Mr. Lin,

41:06.479 --> 41:07.999
I have my reason.

41:09.040 --> 41:10.920
It has nothing to do
with the Holy Maiden.

41:11.640 --> 41:13.559
She has been waiting for you.

41:17.919 --> 41:19.519
I will visit her at night.

41:19.919 --> 41:21.120
Night?

41:22.560 --> 41:24.160
No, it's not nighttime.

41:24.240 --> 41:26.839
It's daytime.
I will visit her once I have time.

41:27.480 --> 41:29.640
Hurry up and get married
when I'm still around.

41:42.080 --> 41:43.320
I was taken aback.

41:43.720 --> 41:45.959
You are healthier than me.

41:46.839 --> 41:48.879
You never know.

41:59.879 --> 42:02.120
Did you teach

42:02.800 --> 42:04.220
Fan Xian that?

42:04.240 --> 42:06.879
No, he figured it out himself.

42:09.080 --> 42:10.260
Given his young age,

42:10.280 --> 42:13.879
he's done a good job
to have come up with this.

42:14.399 --> 42:16.499
Ever since Fan Xian
arrived in the Capital,

42:16.519 --> 42:18.200
he hasn't disappointed anyone.

42:20.160 --> 42:21.680
Are your legs all right?

42:22.000 --> 42:23.620
My legs ache
after standing for too long.

42:23.640 --> 42:24.299
I'm fine.

42:24.319 --> 42:25.140
Don't worry.

42:25.160 --> 42:29.060
I will grant you a chair
in the hall later.

42:29.080 --> 42:30.100
Please don't.

42:30.120 --> 42:31.519
I dare not accept this.

42:31.640 --> 42:34.519
Is Fan Xian registered
under the Fan family's ancestry hall?

42:37.240 --> 42:38.140
Good thing if he isn't.

42:38.160 --> 42:39.720
Judging by his character,

42:40.519 --> 42:41.760
it's better not.

42:42.080 --> 42:43.800
It doesn't matter
whether or not his name is registered.

42:43.810 --> 42:45.540
He belongs to the Fan family anyway.

42:45.640 --> 42:46.640
He may be a troublemaker,

42:46.640 --> 42:47.900
I will continue to guide him more.

42:47.920 --> 42:49.000
If he really gets into trouble,

42:49.000 --> 42:50.299
I will take the blame for him.

42:50.319 --> 42:50.979
You Majesty,

42:50.999 --> 42:52.700
he's always like this.

42:52.720 --> 42:54.919
Only you can tolerate him.

43:16.260 --> 43:18.260
♪ The youth raises his head ♪

43:18.260 --> 43:22.340
♪ As he moves toward his moon ♪

43:23.860 --> 43:25.980
♪ People tease him for being delusional ♪

43:25.980 --> 43:29.760
♪ Wondering why he is so unconventional ♪

43:31.780 --> 43:35.340
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

43:35.340 --> 43:39.260
♪ How could it remain unstained? ♪

43:39.260 --> 43:41.180
♪ If silver tael has a value ♪

43:41.180 --> 43:44.780
♪ Who can truly be carefree? ♪

43:45.500 --> 43:48.180
♪ All of you are right ♪

43:48.200 --> 43:50.420
♪ He said: "Please" ♪

43:50.420 --> 43:53.480
♪ "Make way" ♪

43:53.500 --> 43:55.980
♪ "Let me drink until I drop" ♪

43:55.980 --> 43:57.900
♪ On the court ♪

43:57.900 --> 44:00.920
♪ I recite several verses ♪

44:00.940 --> 44:03.340
♪ Let me wear a white robe ♪

44:03.340 --> 44:05.420
♪ And cross the alley
filled with insanity ♪

44:05.420 --> 44:08.640
♪ To scoop up the moon's reflection
in the muddy pond ♪

44:08.660 --> 44:10.900
♪ Sirs, please forgive me ♪

44:10.900 --> 44:12.860
♪ Your words of advice ♪

44:12.860 --> 44:15.880
♪ I understand,
but I don't want to pretend ♪

44:15.900 --> 44:18.190
♪ People search for the golden land ♪

44:18.190 --> 44:20.260
♪ While I search for the moon ♪

44:20.260 --> 44:22.720
♪ Why should we travel together? ♪

44:22.740 --> 44:24.660
♪ Thank you ♪

44:24.660 --> 44:26.740
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:26.740 --> 44:28.420
♪ You are you ♪

44:28.420 --> 44:30.320
♪ I am me ♪

44:30.340 --> 44:32.260
♪ Thank you ♪

44:32.260 --> 44:34.220
♪ Excuse me ♪

44:34.220 --> 44:36.020
♪ You are you ♪

44:36.020 --> 44:39.480
♪ I am me ♪

44:51.550 --> 44:54.770
♪ Wearing a white robe
when crossing a muddy pond ♪

44:55.150 --> 44:58.620
♪ Remarkably worldly-wise
yet hopelessly romantic ♪

44:58.870 --> 45:02.010
♪ Know what you love ♪

45:02.200 --> 45:04.770
♪ Don't change ♪

45:06.660 --> 45:10.090
♪ If one has witnessed
both light and shadow ♪

45:10.160 --> 45:13.790
♪ Yet retains their innocence ♪

45:13.810 --> 45:16.840
♪ They shall be cloaked in moonlight ♪

45:16.900 --> 45:20.100
♪ As they journey through the night ♪
